[{"title":"续西园咏木芙蓉后十五韵 其十五","author":"成鹫","text":"溪光斜日两相涵，清影和香上客衫。\n我即莲花花即我，水仙何用笑山凡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50144,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五婆城","author":"成鹫","text":"衰草离离雉堞平，牧童空记五婆名。\n当年版筑功何在，悔不骑羊入古城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50145,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"弹子矶 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"欲买丹青写十洲，谁知茎草即璚楼。\n真山真水无人画，笑杀当年顾虎头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50146,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曹溪八颂肉身","author":"成鹫","text":"天上花冠色正萎，那伽大定已多时。\n灵山何事不归去，坐久成劳知未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50147,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"信衣","author":"成鹫","text":"楚人拾得楚人弓，北秀何如塞上翁。\n解道本来无一物，金斓还与刹竿同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50148,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"缀钵","author":"成鹫","text":"拾将瓦砾作黄金，补缀方知用意深。\n一曲无弦人不会，为君漆过断纹琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50149,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"腰石","author":"成鹫","text":"微时故剑不妨求，出匣犹存旧蒯缑。\n莫与铅刀同钝置，当年凭尔觅封侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50150,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"响鞋","author":"成鹫","text":"踏著虚空却有声，出门寸地未曾平。\n而今始识曹溪路，只屦全抛自在行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50151,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨敕","author":"成鹫","text":"梵语华言墨沈新，九重珍重下温纶。\n吾家自了无文字，莫向黄麻认主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50152,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"念珠","author":"成鹫","text":"为止儿啼转法轮，却拈黄叶作家珍。\n殷勤为报南宗道，莫把明珠错赠人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50153,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝环","author":"成鹫","text":"从来吾道有循环，留与儿孙著眼看。\n觌面相呈衣线事，当中圆月照心寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50154,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞十二绝 其一 半山亭","author":"成鹫","text":"百城烟水总波波，一个閒人此地过。\n莫道閒忙分各半，上山人少下山多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50155,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞十二绝 其二 紫玉台","author":"成鹫","text":"玉台频上不辞劳，晴雪和花拥毳袍。\n紫石碧栏行坐稳，下方遥见谓孤高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50156,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞十二绝 其三 海山门","author":"成鹫","text":"天空云海捲松涛，独往不知山路高。\n百尺竿头谁进步，一门深入属吾曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50157,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞十二绝 其四 大明岩","author":"成鹫","text":"一峰南面众流清，半角山光尽向明。\n薇蕨不留夷叔去，萧条古道少人行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50158,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞十二绝 其五 片鳞岩","author":"成鹫","text":"千松千竹倚千岩，一石一泉成一庵。\n尽道乘龙人去后，片鳞留影在山南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50159,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞十二绝 其六 舵盘岩","author":"成鹫","text":"般若虚舟列百珍，片帆无恙度迷津。\n而今法海波涛静，犹忆当时秉舵人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50160,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞十二绝 其七 御风亭","author":"成鹫","text":"拟学飞仙念已灰，御风半月未归来。\n老僧平地行偏稳，踏上丹梯日几回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50161,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞十二绝 其八 雾隐岩","author":"成鹫","text":"一半蹲鸱出懒残，炉头珍重许分餐。\n榻边恰好容高卧，莫作南山泽豹看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50162,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞十二绝 其九 梦觉关","author":"成鹫","text":"月窗半榻枕松筠，石上花开几度春。\n山色不殊春梦觉，觉时依旧梦时人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50163,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞十二绝 其十 茅竹岩","author":"成鹫","text":"芳泉影里添千个，连璧堂前列万竿。\n更把双松比孤竹，岁寒争羡弟兄难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50164,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞十二绝 其十一 洪岩","author":"成鹫","text":"更上一层山外山，茶烟如缕出重关。\n老僧记得同游约，缚竹悬梯待客攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50165,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹霞十二绝 其十二 龙爪岩","author":"成鹫","text":"龙尾招呼龙爪闻，下山十里又逢君。\n何年突出拿空手，攫取丹霞一片云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50166,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得玉兰秋放送关若垂孝廉北上 其一","author":"成鹫","text":"槐花黄遍桂花香，琪树琼葩出众芳。\n莫倚西风惜迟暮，秋光应不异春光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50167,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得玉兰秋放送关若垂孝廉北上 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"时至何须羯鼓催，玉堂先见一花开。\n洛阳城里春如锦，昨日看花人又来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50168,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得玉兰秋放送关若垂孝廉北上 其三","author":"成鹫","text":"含香簪笔入枫宸，二月莺啼上苑春。\n好去济川作舟楫，不妨原是此花身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50169,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得玉兰秋放送关若垂孝廉北上 其四","author":"成鹫","text":"我在山中亦种花，和云埽雪护兰芽。\n琼林千树生春色，南橘无媒祇自誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50170,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题玉兰图赠杨澹山 其一","author":"成鹫","text":"仙葩倚石近华堂，薄粉轻烟见靓妆。\n识得澹山真澹处，可知入室不闻香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50171,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题玉兰图赠杨澹山 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"澹妆虢国想依稀，海燕将雏带粉归。\n昨夜梦兰还比玉，碧阶斑戏映芳菲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50172,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题玉兰图赠杨澹山 其三","author":"成鹫","text":"汾江物色逐年新，高友从兹永结邻。\n携上木兰舟上去，不应忘却此花身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50173,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹊顶蛛眉颂","author":"成鹫","text":"舍却轮王不肯休，还从雪岭逞风流。\n明星未豁摩醯眼，蜎动飞鸣得自由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50174,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壁观默坐颂","author":"成鹫","text":"古佛全身没覆藏，偏从脑后放毫光。\n黑山鬼窟翻筋斗，引得儿孙尽面墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50175,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"腰石书壁颂","author":"成鹫","text":"槽厂佣舂惯躲跟，点头顽石要相烦。\n本来解道原无物，却羡人添壁上痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50176,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长汀布袋颂","author":"成鹫","text":"笑杀明州胖子禅，街头舒手乞文钱。\n展开布袋全无用，里不成方外不圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50177,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒山拾得颂","author":"成鹫","text":"智行无端堕浊尘，两家欢喜一家嗔。\n閒吟冷笑皆饶舌，何待丰干说向人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50178,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"懒残粪芋颂","author":"成鹫","text":"内诏传宣视漠然，炉头偏有邺侯缘。\n十年宰相三更梦，半芋原来不值钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50179,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"普化摇铎颂","author":"成鹫","text":"摇铃振铎撒风颠，到处游行到处禅。\n明暗两头都坐断，一条直裰著谁穿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50180,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华亭船子颂","author":"成鹫","text":"雨笠风蓑任陆沉，呈桡舞■为知音。\n金鳞曳断竿头线，明月芦花何处寻。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50181,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙山遗菜颂","author":"成鹫","text":"口腹由来是祸胎，泥牛相见闹豗豗。\n莫言去后无消息，黄叶何因引得来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50182,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蚬子台盘","author":"成鹫","text":"老树玲珑白玉枝，月明孤影自相宜。\n风来领取真香去，借问同根知未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50183,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙牛岭阻雪即事 其一","author":"成鹫","text":"来时踏破山中雪，归路重经雪里山。\n十里黄云蔽斜日，远游何事不知还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50184,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙牛岭阻雪即事 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"话尽寒宵火一围，佛灯明灭月光微。\n推窗错讶东方白，柳絮和风点衲衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50185,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙牛岭阻雪即事 其三","author":"成鹫","text":"冻压茅檐户不开，閒云野鹤心悠哉。\n凭谁报语家山道，雪岭淹留人未回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50186,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙牛岭阻雪即事 其四","author":"成鹫","text":"银山如画画应难，琪树琼枝玉作坛。\n自是东风太狼藉